  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.4234619140625,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "The likelihood of treatment success in MDR/RR-TB patients on longer regimens depends on factors",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.3536987304688,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "related to the patient and strain of TB (e.g. severity of disease, resistance patterns and comorbidities),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993748664855957,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.3905029296875,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "and access to health care (e.g. regimens with sufficient effective agents, medications of good quality,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.2783203125,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "management of AEs and patient support). Longer regimens with sufficient effective agents are known",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981083869934082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        118.91474151611328,
        527.4177856445312,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "(70–73) to increase the likelihood of cure and lower the risk of death in adults and children  . The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.450927734375,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "composition of longer regimens is governed by the selection of individual medicines considered to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        524.434814453125,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "be effective, and by a need to combine sufficient medicines to maximize the likelihood of relapse-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.3892822265625,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "free cure without increasing toxicity. Regimens may be of standardized (fixed) composition or may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        527.4365844726562,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "be individualized to the patient’s needs. Longer regimens usually last 18–20 months or more; this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.1907501220703,
        527.4103393554688,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "document provides recommendations on the duration of such regimens, updated since publication",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        198.1147003173828,
        527.4130249023438,
        213.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "(13) of the 2011 WHO guidelines  . In summary, in 2018, a total treatment duration of 18–20 months",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        212.59071350097656,
        527.5550537109375,
        227.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "and a treatment duration of 15–17 months after culture conversion were suggested for most patients,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976675033569336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.7906036376953,
        436.82958984375,
        240.2335968017578
      ],
      "text": "with the duration being modified according to the patient’s response to therapy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        256.634521484375,
        219.68531799316406,
        272.2945251464844
      ],
      "text": "Evidence base and analyses",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.50238037109375,
        527.4301147460938,
        293.9454040527344
      ],
      "text": "Ahead of the GDG discussion in 2018, WHO made a public call for individual MDR/RR-TB patient data,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966248512268066,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        291.4263916015625,
        527.5206909179688,
        307.1454162597656
      ],
      "text": "(74) complete with results of treatment  {, 2018 #35;, 2018 #35}. IPD meta-analysis in adults and children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.957366943359375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        305.90252685546875,
        527.3969116210938,
        320.3455505371094
      ],
      "text": "treated with longer MDR/RR-TB regimens allows the study of useful correlates of outcome, including",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        317.826416015625,
        527.3968505859375,
        333.5454406738281
      ],
      "text": "(70–72) the regimen composition  . The evidence base for the effectiveness of many of the medicines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        332.3023986816406,
        527.3925170898438,
        346.74542236328125
      ],
      "text": "used in MDR/RR-TB regimens relies on the 2018 IPD meta-analysis. In turn, this IPD meta-analysis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        345.5024108886719,
        527.4322509765625,
        359.9454345703125
      ],
      "text": "relies heavily on observational studies, only a few of which have employed randomized controlled",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        357.4263916015625,
        527.3843383789062,
        373.1454162597656
      ],
      "text": "(21) designs  ; hence, the overall certainty of evidence is often graded as low or very low. The sources",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.90240478515625,
        508.0502624511719,
        386.3454284667969
      ],
      "text": "of data used by the GDGs to address the PICO questions in this section are summarized below.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.7137145996094,
        442.3900146484375,
        411.0686950683594
      ],
      "text": "PICO question 3–2018 (MDR/RR-TB, 2018) (choice of individual medicines)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.5276184082031,
        527.4244995117188,
        432.97064208984375
      ],
      "text": "First, to analyse treatment success, treatment failure, relapse and death for the individual medicines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.72760009765625,
        527.3870239257812,
        446.1706237792969
      ],
      "text": "in longer regimens, the 2018 IPD meta-analysis was used, with 13 104 records from 53 studies in 40",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.9276123046875,
        527.132568359375,
        459.3706359863281
      ],
      "text": "countries. The 2018 IPD contained datasets from preceding years and from several countries, including",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95535945892334,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        458.1275939941406,
        527.3893432617188,
        472.57061767578125
      ],
      "text": "a large dataset from South Africa with many patients treated with bedaquiline-containing regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.3276062011719,
        527.2088623046875,
        485.7706298828125
      ],
      "text": "Second, to analyse AEs resulting in permanent discontinuation of individual medicines in longer",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.5276184082031,
        527.44677734375,
        498.97064208984375
      ],
      "text": "regimens, a subset of 5450 records from 17 studies in the 2018 IPD was used, supplemented with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        496.45159912109375,
        527.4156494140625,
        512.1705932617188
      ],
      "text": "n additional information from 10 other studies that only reported AEs for either bedaquiline ( =130),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        509.651611328125,
        267.6390686035156,
        525.37060546875
      ],
      "text": "n n linezolid ( =508) or carbapenems ( =139).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.631591796875,
        527.3980712890625,
        547.0745849609375
      ],
      "text": "In addition to these data, the GDG 2018 assessed unpublished results from the Phase 3 Trial 213 of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.5556030273438,
        527.1434326171875,
        560.2745971679688
      ],
      "text": "(75, 76) delamanid   and safety and pharmacological exposure data from unpublished paediatric studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.962586402893066,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.031494140625,
        527.4058227539062,
        573.4744873046875
      ],
      "text": "of bedaquiline (Phase 2 TMC207-C211 and Phase 1–2 IMPAACT P1108) and delamanid (Phase 1",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.2315673828125,
        527.3882446289062,
        586.674560546875
      ],
      "text": "242–12–245, Phase 1 242–12–232, Phase 2 242–07–204 and Phase 2 242–12–233). The GDG 2018",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.431640625,
        527.3951416015625,
        599.8746337890625
      ],
      "text": "also searched the literature for studies reporting outcomes of patients treated with agents other than",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993597984313965,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        598.631591796875,
        483.1636962890625,
        613.0745849609375
      ],
      "text": "those included in the 2016 guidelines (e.g. perchlozone, interferon gamma and sutezolid).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        623.4429321289062,
        487.11273193359375,
        637.7979125976562
      ],
      "text": "PICO question 4–2018 (MDR/RR-TB, 2018) (number of agents likely to be effective)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.2568359375,
        527.433837890625,
        659.6998291015625
      ],
      "text": "To analyse treatment success, treatment failure, relapse and death for the optimal number of medicines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.953149795532227,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.456787109375,
        527.4617309570312,
        672.8997802734375
      ],
      "text": "to be included in longer regimens, the data were derived from a subset of 8957 patients in 47 studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993147850036621,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.65673828125,
        527.4163818359375,
        686.0997314453125
      ],
      "text": "included in the IPD used for PICO question 2–2018 (MDR/RR-TB, 2018) above. Of these, 3570 patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966348648071289,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        684.856689453125,
        527.448974609375,
        699.2996826171875
      ],
      "text": "in 16 studies had information on the start and end dates for individual medicines in which DST was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        698.0568237304688,
        527.4124145507812,
        712.4998168945312
      ],
      "text": "reported, and 5387 patients in 31 studies had information on individual medicines used in both the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        711.2568359375,
        527.4378662109375,
        725.6998291015625
      ],
      "text": "intensive and continuation phases of treatment, as well as DST results. This question focused on the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        724.456787109375,
        527.4419555664062,
        738.8997802734375
      ],
      "text": "number of agents in the intensive phase; hence, patients who did not receive an injectable agent",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        736.3807373046875,
        527.4215698242188,
